WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.420
Create, then Docker Image: nginx:1.27 deploys to an empty canvas. The wait is sped up and labelled.

2
00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:11.700
Add Postgres. It runs as its own service with a volume.

3
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:19.400
Set DATABASE_URL on nginx to ${{Postgres.DATABASE_URL}}, then redeploy.

4
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.600
In Settings, Networking, Generate Domain gives nginx a public HTTPS name.

5
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.000
Open the name: the nginx welcome page, served over HTTPS.
